<title>FINLAND: Finnish T-bill auction raises 690 mln markka.</title>
<headline>Finnish T-bill auction raises 690 mln markka.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury Office's T-Bill auction February 25 versus February 18:</p>
<p>			THIS AUCTION/PREVIOUS AUCTION</p>
<p> Maturity, days   138	  230	    351/358</p>
<p> Avge yld, pct    No	   3.12	  3.24/3.26</p>
<p> Highest yld	bids	 3.12	  3.24/3.26</p>
<p> Lowest  yld	accepted   3.11	  3.24/3.26</p>
<p> Amount,FIM million   nil	  360	    330/3,025</p>
<p> Bids, FIM million    4,565	560	    460/6,800</p>
<p>After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 45,243 million markka, the STO said.  </p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248</p>
